        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_e476a4f9-8494-5d33-81fb-4f3f6dd36c33" LONG-NAME="ACC-SYS-FUN-001" LAST-CHANGE="2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ACC-SYS-FUN-001">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-ID</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="Operating state set">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-TITLE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-CHAPTER</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-CH-FUNCTIONAL-HMI</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>The ACC system shall provide the operating states Off, Standby, Active-Cruise, Active-Follow, Active-Hold, Driver-Override and Degraded-Fault.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-TEXT</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-EARS-PATTERN</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-EARS-UBIQUITOUS</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-SYSTEM-STATES</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-OFF</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-STANDBY</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-CRUISE</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-FOLLOW</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-HOLD</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-DRIVER-OVERRIDE</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-DEGRADED-FAULT</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>ISO 15622:2018 defines ACC behaviour as a set of control sub-states, the speed control sub-state (cl. 3.12.2), the following control sub-state (cl. 3.12.5) and the FSRA hold state (cl. 3.12.6), and cl. 6.1 requires an FSRA-type system to change into the hold state after standstill. The standard does not enumerate a complete state set for an implementation, so the seven-state set is project-owned: Off, Standby, Active-Cruise, Active-Follow and Active-Hold map onto the sub-states of the standard plus the inactive conditions, Driver-Override carries the cl. 6.3.1 pedal precedence, and Degraded-Fault carries the cl. 6.6 failure reactions. Overlap rule O2 places the existence of every state, including Degraded-Fault, in the Functional chapter. Owned by the systems engineer, 2026-08-18.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-RATIONALE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ISO 15622:2018 cl. 3.12.2; ISO 15622:2018 cl. 3.12.5; ISO 15622:2018 cl. 3.12.6; PROJECT-CHOICE:systems-engineer">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-SOURCE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-TAG</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VT-DERIVED</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-METHOD</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VM-INSPECTION</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-MEASURAND</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-STATUS</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-STAT-DRAFT</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="1.0">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-REVISION</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="F2">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-FIGURE-REFS</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ACC-SYS-FUN-002, ACC-SYS-FUN-005, ACC-SYS-SAF-021">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-RELATED-REQS</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-VERIFIED-BY</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
          </VALUES>
          <TYPE>
            <SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>ST-ACC-SYS-REQ</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
          </TYPE>
        </SPEC-OBJECT>
        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_8d4fa225-8139-54ae-9613-58443b8119bf" LONG-NAME="ACC-SYS-FUN-002" LAST-CHANGE="2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ACC-SYS-FUN-002">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-ID</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="Entry to Standby on ignition on">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-TITLE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-CHAPTER</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-CH-FUNCTIONAL-HMI</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>When the ignition is switched on, the ACC system shall enter the Standby state.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-TEXT</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-EARS-PATTERN</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-EARS-EVENTDRIVEN</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-SYSTEM-STATES</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-OFF</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-STANDBY</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>The ACC system needs a defined powered but inactive condition from which the driver can activate it, and a defined entry into that condition. No retrieved clause of ISO 15622:2018 specifies the power-on state, so the choice of Standby rather than Off after ignition on is project-owned; it is the behaviour that makes the cl. 6.2.1 activation transition reachable without a separate main switch. Owned by the systems engineer, 2026-08-18.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-RATIONALE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="PROJECT-CHOICE:systems-engineer">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-SOURCE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-TAG</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VT-DERIVED</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-METHOD</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
