        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_35395366-e59c-5591-8aa7-feebef9af452" LONG-NAME="ACC-SYS-FUN-021" LAST-CHANGE="2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ACC-SYS-FUN-021">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-ID</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="Control-mode arbitration between set speed and following">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-TITLE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-CHAPTER</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-CH-FUNCTIONAL-HMI</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>While the ACC system is in the Active-Cruise state or the Active-Follow state, the ACC system shall control the subject vehicle speed to the lower of the set speed and the speed required to maintain the selected time gap to the target vehicle.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-TEXT</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-EARS-PATTERN</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-EARS-STATEDRIVEN</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-SYSTEM-STATES</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-CRUISE</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-FOLLOW</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>ISO 15622:2018 cl. 6.1 states that when ACC is active the vehicle speed shall be controlled automatically either to maintain a clearance to a forward vehicle or to maintain the set speed, whichever speed is lower, and cl. 6.2.1 states the transition between the two control modes shall be made automatically. This requirement fixes the arbitration; the automatic-transition obligation is carried separately by ACC-SYS-FUN-022 so that neither statement is compound (INCOSE R19). The phrase "the lower of A and B" is a single selection response, not two combined responses, so R20 is satisfied.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-RATIONALE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ISO 15622:2018 cl. 6.1; ISO 15622:2018 cl. 6.2.1">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-SOURCE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-TAG</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VT-PRIMARY</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-METHOD</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VM-TEST</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="v_ego [m/s]; v_set [m/s]; d_clearance [m]; acc_control_mode [enum]">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-MEASURAND</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-STATUS</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-STAT-DRAFT</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="1.0">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-REVISION</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
