        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_6df529aa-cd6e-51cc-af01-f1509d8c6066" LONG-NAME="ACC-SYS-SAF-002" LAST-CHANGE="2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="ACC-SYS-SAF-002">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-ID</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="Detection of stale vehicle bus signals">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-TITLE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-CHAPTER</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-CH-SAFETY-FAULT-HANDLING</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>If the ACC system detects that a vehicle bus signal used for longitudinal control has not been updated for more than 200 ms, then the ACC system shall set the vehicle bus health signal to the stale value within 100 ms of that detection.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-TEXT</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-EARS-PATTERN</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-EARS-UNWANTEDBEHAVIOUR</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-SYSTEM-STATES</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-STANDBY</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-CRUISE</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-FOLLOW</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-ST-ACTIVE-HOLD</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>
                  <xhtml:p>No retrieved clause of ISO 15622:2018 addresses vehicle bus signal timeouts; cl. 6.6 failure reactions is past the truncation point of the publisher-hosted preview. Both windows are project-owned. 200 ms is chosen as four periods of the 50 ms nominal wheel-speed and yaw-rate transmission cycle shown crossing the system boundary in figure F1, which tolerates isolated frame loss without tolerating a silent sender; 100 ms keeps the health signal ahead of the 200 ms state transition of ACC-SYS-SAF-022. Owned by the systems engineer, 2026-08-18.</xhtml:p>
                </xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>AD-RATIONALE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="PROJECT-CHOICE:systems-engineer">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>AD-SOURCE</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-STRING-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-TAG</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VT-DERIVED</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>AD-VERIFICATION-METHOD</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>EV-VM-TEST</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-STRING THE-VALUE="bus_health [enum]; v_ego [m/s]; t [s]">
